{
  "$schema": "./styles.schema.json",
  "name": "purafield-yoga-styles",
  "version": "2026-11-10.1",
  "description": "Canonical yoga class style taxonomy shared by Tandava, TeacherTree, CueCraft (yogaflow, CueCraft-iOS), ClassStamp and the studio directory. Top-level public styles are what users filter by; hidden child styles keep finer detail (for example the kinds of Power Vinyasa) for matching, search and analytics.",
  "rules": [
    "id is permanent. Never rename or reuse an id; deprecate with \"deprecated\": true.",
    "label is the display name. When apps.teachertree is set, label must equal it exactly, because TeacherTree stores these strings on saved classes.",
    "apps.<app> is the exact string or key that app uses today, or null when that app does not list the style.",
    "A child (parent set) counts as its parent for filtering: a studio tagged power-vinyasa matches the Power Yoga filter.",
    "visibility public = may appear as a filter or chip; hidden = stored and searchable, not shown as its own facet.",
    "kind level and fallback are never directory style facets.",
    "aliases are lowercase phrases used to match free text (studio names, class titles, speech). Brand method names are hidden tags only, never claims about a studio's affiliation unless the studio states it."
  ],
